term,definition
id,The ID of the 3 seconds audio snippet
analysis,The list of models that has been run on the audio snippet
scientificName,The species detected by BirdNET in the audio snippet
englishName,The species detected by BirdNET in the audio snippet
start_secs,"The time the detection has started, relative to the length of the audio file"
end_secs,"The time the detection has ended, relative to the length of the audio file"
confidence,"The model confidence, i.e. how sure is BirdNET of the detection"
detected_time,"The start time the detection has been made, absolute time CET"
detected_time_end,"The end time the detection has been made, absolute time CET"
audio_id,The ID of the file the snippet belongs to
upload_time,"The time (CET), the file (audio_id) has been uploaded to the Google Cloud bucket"
project,The project the file (audio_id) belongs to
recorder,The ID of the acoustic device that has recorded the file (audio_id)
site,The name of the site where the recorder has been deployed
latitude,Latitude coordinate of the site where the recorder has been deployed
longitude,Longitude coordinate of the site where the recorder has been deployed
audio_link,The link to the raw audio file (audio_id) the snippet belongs to
